---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Resume">
  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">Background</p>
    <h1>Resume</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      4+ years across research, data engineering, and analytics — from GenAI research tools at an
      economic development consultancy to enterprise BI migrations at one of India's largest
      insurers.
    </p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn" href="/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download PDF</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Experience</h2>

    <div class="timeline-item">
      <h3>Data Scientist / R&amp;D Analyst</h3>
      <div class="role-meta">TIP Strategies · Aug 2023 – Present</div>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li>
          Built local RAG applications (Python, Ollama, LlamaIndex) to query 30 years of reports and
          summarize SEC filings, cutting research turnaround by 20%.
        </li>
        <li>
          Automated data pipelines via GCP and Python microservices and the Gemini API to generate
          dataset summaries and update client-facing Tableau dashboards, saving 3 hours per project
          and driving add-on revenue in 20% of engagements.
        </li>
        <li>
          Forecasted labor impacts using LSTM models and historical job data. Simulated expansion
          scenarios and reduced forecast variance by 40%, informing workforce planning for a $17B
          regional investment.
        </li>
        <li>
          Deployed Hugging Face zero-shot classification models to categorize grant data and build
          knowledge graphs, replacing a rule-based system and improving accuracy by 30%.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built a geospatial transit framework (Python, NetworkX) to process GTFS data and score
          route capacity. Visualized networks in Tableau for 10+ projects, reducing analysis time
          from days to minutes.
        </li>
        <li>
          Deployed a local, custom OpenRouteService instance via Docker to process isochrone and
          drive-time queries, cutting processing time by 50% and enabling rapid site-selection
          analysis.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built a national freight data framework in Python to analyze supply chain networks and
          benchmark trade hubs, launching a new analytical product utilized in 3+ client projects.
        </li>
        <li>
          AI adoption champion: drove secure, cross-functional rollout of generative-AI tools across
          research and outreach workflows.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline-item">
      <h3>Teaching Assistant</h3>
      <div class="role-meta">New York University · Jan 2023 – Jul 2023</div>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li>
          Instructed students in supervised and unsupervised machine learning methods, including
          ensemble methods and anomaly detection, using Python.
        </li>
        <li>
          Supported a disaster-management course utilizing Power BI for spatial and risk analysis.
        </li>
        <li>
          Assisted graduate courses: Machine Learning for Cities; Data Analytics of Urban Systems
          Failures.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline-item">
      <h3>Data Analyst</h3>
      <div class="role-meta">ICICI Lombard General Insurance Company · Feb 2021 – Aug 2022</div>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li>
          Integrated multi-terabyte datasets via Azure (Data Lake, Synapse) to migrate legacy SAP BO
          dashboards and develop 40+ Power BI financial reports, reducing report rendering time by
          90% and centralizing operational tracking.
        </li>
        <li>
          Built topographic risk dashboards in Power BI using elevation and precipitation data to
          identify flood-prone infrastructure across 100+ miles of commercial highway projects,
          providing clients with realignment strategies to reduce insurance costs and support
          retention.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Education</h2>

    <div class="timeline-item">
      <h3>New York University</h3>
      <div class="role-meta">M.S. Applied Urban Science and Informatics · Sep 2022 – Aug 2023</div>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li>Graduated with a 3.9 GPA and received the Scholastic Award.</li>
        <li>
          Graduate coursework: Applied Data Science, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, Decision
          Modelling, Complex Systems, Big Data, AI and Data Ethics, Fairness, Urban Data Science
          Intensive Capstone, Spatial Data Analysis, Public Policy.
        </li>
        <li>
          Conducted statistical analysis on eye-tracker data for an NYU Langone Health study, applying
          machine learning models to identify behavioral anomalies.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline-item">
      <h3>Manipal Institute of Technology</h3>
      <div class="role-meta">B.Tech in Electronics &amp; Communication Engineering · Jul 2017 – Jul 2021</div>
      <ul class="bullets">
        <li>
          Minor in Data Science: built a strong quantitative foundation through applied projects and
          coursework in statistical inference, network analysis, linear algebra, calculus, and R
          programming.
        </li>
        <li>
          Relevant coursework: Signal Processing, Transforms, Reproducible Research, Data Cleaning,
          Exploratory Data Analysis, Data Product Design.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Skills &amp; Expertise</h2>

    <div class="skill-group">
      <h4>Languages</h4>
      <p>
        Python (Pandas, GeoPandas, Rasterio, GDAL, Transformers, LlamaIndex, Streamlit, PySpark,
        Scikit-learn, TensorFlow, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Folium, Statsmodels, BeautifulSoup, Scrapy),
        R (ggplot2, Leaflet, Plotly), SQL, DAX, Power Query M Code
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-group">
      <h4>Machine Learning &amp; AI</h4>
      <p>
        Generative AI (RAG, Agentic Modeling), Time-Series (LSTM), NLP (Hugging Face), Predictive
        Analytics, Anomaly Detection, Neural Networks, SVM, KNN, Clustering, Ensemble Methods,
        Gaussian Processes, Semi-Supervised Learning, Expectation Maximization, Agent-Based Models,
        Bayesian Networks
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-group">
      <h4>LLM Stack &amp; Frameworks</h4>
      <p>LlamaIndex, LangChain, Ollama, Gemini API, Vector DBs (ChromaDB)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-group">
      <h4>Cloud &amp; Data Architecture</h4>
      <p>GCP (BigQuery, Vertex AI), AWS (S3), REST API Integration, MapReduce, Dask, Apache Spark, Hadoop</p>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-group">
      <h4>Visualization &amp; Geospatial</h4>
      <p>Tableau, Power BI, ArcGIS, OpenRouteService</p>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-group">
      <h4>Statistics</h4>
      <p>ARIMA, A/B Testing, PCA, Resampling Methods, Regression Techniques, Network Analysis</p>
    </div>

    <div class="skill-group">
      <h4>Developer Tools</h4>
      <p>Git, Docker, Advanced Excel, STATA</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
